                              {
                                  "q":  "Is PAYCHEK \"just another\" trading journal?",
                                  "aHtml":  "\u003cdiv class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed font-medium space-y-3 text-left\" lang=\"en\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eYes—and no.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500 select-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e•\u003c/span\u003e Yes, because journaling stays effortless. In seconds you log Forex, Crypto or Indices without wrestling with brittle spreadsheets.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-500 select-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e•\u003c/span\u003e No, because PAYCHEK runs a disciplined analytics stack behind the scenes—turning your entries into robust performance KPIs plus a playbook audit that exposes psychological slip-ups.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn short: entry stays simple; the insights read like institutional research.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e"
                              },
                              {
                                  "q":  "Is my data secure?",
                                  "aHtml":  "\u003cp class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed font-medium\"\u003eAbsolutely. Data is encrypted in transit and at rest. We never resell trading statistics—you remain the sole owner of everything you capture.\u003c/p\u003e"
                              },
                              {
                                  "q":  "How does the free trial work?",
                                  "aHtml":  "\u003cp class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed font-medium\"\u003eSignup unlocks seven full days of every Pro capability. After the trial ends you choose Pro—or stay on Lite with the essentials still available.\u003c/p\u003e"
                              },
                              {
                                  "q":  "Can I cancel whenever I want?",
                                  "aHtml":  "\u003cp class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed font-medium\"\u003eYes. There is no minimum term—cancel Pro anytime from billing settings while keeping access until the paid period concludes.\u003c/p\u003e"
                              },
                              {
                                  "q":  "Which markets are supported?",
                                  "aHtml":  "\u003cp class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed font-medium\"\u003eAll major liquid markets—Forex, crypto, indices, commodities and equities. Track every asset consistently inside one playbook.\u003c/p\u003e"
                              },
                              {
